Subject: [PATCH] test(Select): cover popup listbox and option ARIA roles with
 axe

Render the open popup next to the selector and check the
combobox -> listbox -> option wiring (aria-controls, aria-selected,
aria-disabled, aria-activedescendant), then run axe on the open popup
for single, search, multiple, tags and grouped options.

ref #11600
